  dct:description "The aim of the project is to carry out an updated assessment of ecological condition in Norwegian mountain ecosystems in accordance with the index method, as well as follow-up development needs. The condition assessments shall be carried out at both national and regional levels. If the data basis is assessed well enough, it shall also be assessed at the county level, as well as in the low, middle and high-alpine zones."@en;
  dct:title "Updated ecological condition assessment in rock in accordance with the index method."@en;
  adms:identifier <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/d14a3a6b-97fd-410c-b79a-c7c40917c37a-01/Identifier/LOT-0000> .

